    },
    "description": {
      "value": "These goggles feature highly reflective lenses. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +1 item bonus to visual Perception checks and to saving throws against visual effects.\n\n- **Activate:** Reaction\n- **Trigger:** A creature within 60 feet targets you with a visual effect\n\nYou turn your head to reflect aspects of the triggering effect back at its creator. The creature must attempt a DC 20 Fortitude save as it becomes disoriented by this reflection. On a failure, the creature is sickened 1 (sickened 2 on a critical failure). The creature is temporarily immune for 1 hour.\n\nThe item bonus is +2, and the DC is 30."
    },
